            "template": {
              "_type": "Component",
              "template": {
                "type": "prompt",
                "required": true,
                "show": true,
                "multiline": true,
                "name": "template",
                "display_name": "Template",
                "advanced": false,
                "value": "You are a disciplined XAUUSD (gold) intraday analyst.\n\nMarket context:\n{context}\n\nDecide whether to BUY, SELL, or HOLD. Be conservative: answer HOLD unless the setup is clear.\n\nReply with ONLY a JSON object, no prose and no code fences:\n{\n  \"side\": \"BUY\" | \"SELL\" | \"HOLD\",\n  \"confidence\": 0.0-1.0,\n  \"entry\": number or null,\n  \"stop_loss\": number or null,\n  \"take_profit\": number or null,\n  \"rationale\": \"one short sentence\"\n}\n\nRules:\n- A BUY stop_loss sits BELOW entry; a SELL stop_loss sits ABOVE entry.\n- Target at least 1.5x the stop distance.\n- Keep the stop within roughly 1-2x ATR.\n- Use confidence below 0.6 when unsure; the bridge will reject it, which is the safe outcome."
              },
              "context": {
                "type": "str",
                "required": false,
                "show": true,
                "multiline": true,
                "name": "context",
                "display_name": "context",
                "advanced": false,
